{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309790","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309790","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130979001:1":{"text":"응, 지난번에 마을 근처에 숨어있는데, 누나한테 잡혀 돌아갔지 뭐야.","source_cn":"是啊，我上次躲在部落附近，就被我姐拧着耳朵抓回去了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F1AE0362FCC0BB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130979002:1":{"text":"저 외지에서 온 상인들한테서 최면이라도 걸린 건지 다들 보물을 찾겠다고 난리야.","source_cn":"也不知道那些外面来的商人给他们灌了什么迷魂药，非要大伙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB47E9CA430202F61","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130979003:1":{"text":"내가 보기엔… 나 빼고 마을의 젊은이들은 아마 전부 다 갔을 걸?","source_cn":"我估摸着……除了我之外，部落里的年轻人应该都去了吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x100C746B39D93D45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1130979004:1":{"text":"그러고 보니… 나도 참 청개구리야! 하하!","source_cn":"这么一想……我还真是叛逆啊！哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B1E2BF9465DC9CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血戈雷":{"text":"그레이","source":"蛮血戈雷","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":5,"localized_text_count":4,"speaker_count":1}}